<title>UK: CIR International sets 200 bln lire five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>CIR International sets 200 bln lire five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Banca Commerciale Italiana and Chase.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CIR INTERNATIONAL SA</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  CIR </p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN LIRE  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +50 BP    PAY DATE    14.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.375</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p>NOTES  PUT AND CALL AT PAR IN JULY 2000  LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS</p>
<p> US/UK/IT/LX</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ITALY     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
